gTe(){return"Tap a slot to open the card keyboard; cards fill in order and the next empty slot is picked for you.\nDouble-tap a card to send it back to the keyboard.\n\u201cRange\u201d sets an opponent's hands instead of exact cards.\nDB next to the game name adds a second board; per-board equity is colour-coded.\n\u201cDead cards\u201d are cards that cannot come.\n\u201cFold\u201d on a player moves their cards to dead cards."},
