gTk(){return"Kitchen Poker"},
gTj(){return"Bet tracking without chips: create a session, enter players and stacks.\nBefore a hand you can add a straddle or a bomb pot (in Advanced settings).\nAct with \u201cFold\u201d, \u201cCall\u201d, \u201cRaise\u201d; set the size with the slider. \u201cStep back\u201d undoes the last action.\nAt showdown, pick the winner of each part of the pot.\nThe gear fixes names, format and stacks; fixes appear in the honesty report.\n\u201cHistory\u201d shows hands, totals, re-buys, cash-outs and settlement."},
